rks would be yet another sciencey-adjacent faction in a gameline already laden with them (although it would certainly stand out in its own way). On the other hand, Wolfram &amp; Hart would much more readily bring a directly occult angle that official Deviant material is currently a touch short on, and seems like it could quite easily brush up against the Inferno or Maeljin specifically, and either would be <i>a lot</i> of fun.<br /> <br /> Whichever one of the two <i>doesn't</i> win out here might wind up getting homebrewed for my own use, but I think I'm gonna vote <b><u>B</u></b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I've got a bit of a bad habit of extensively editing my posts after the fact. Please try and bear with me...<br /> In case you're comfortable being more friendly and casual about things, my name's Seren, or Es/Es for short. They/Them or Fae/Faer, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3946-sconce","name":"Sconce","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"127"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-28T17:16:18-07:00","id":1461890,"title":"","content":"For whatever it's worth, I know absolutely nothing about Overwatch, the Blackwatch I'm thinking of is 100% [PROTOTYPE].","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/