ve to go with B). They sound the most interesting, from a uneducated perspective. Could have fun interactions with other game-lines.<br /> <br /> (side note, I feel Overwatch would have been a good potential choice. Maybe not the best choice, but far from bad. The characters in Talon/Blackwatch just seem to fit Deviant well. Oh well.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-29T23:03:55-07:00","id":1462084,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TempleBuilder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1461816-monster-mash-2021-round-3-deviant?p=1462075#post1462075\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A \u2026 overzealous organization of disease prevention?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;<a href=\"https://prototype.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Soldier\" target=\"_blank\">Overzealous</a>&quot; is one word. &quot;Disease <i>prevention</i>&quot; is <a href=\"https://prototype.fandom.com/wiki/Redlight_virus\" target=\"_blank\">perhaps one too many</a>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> (side note, I feel Overwatch would have been a good potential choice. Maybe not the best choice, but far from bad. The characters in Talon/Blackwatch just seem to fit Deviant well. Oh well.) </div> </div> </div>As much as I would love to see <a href=\"https://worsethanmanyfairies.tumblr.com/post/171509469890/ladysmaragdina-xekstrin-dykemoira-both\" target=\"_blank\">Moira O'Deorain give a rabbit ghost powers</a>, I've only got the one vote to spend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T05:34:53-07:00","id":1462121,"title":"","content":"Casting my vote for <b>B</b>. As someone said earlier, Deviant has a lot of super-science focus and could use more occult Conspiracies.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12220-dark-lord-potato","name":"Dark Lord Potato","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12220_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-09-30T08:07:57-07:00","id":1462134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1461816-monster-mash-2021-round-3-deviant?p=1462084#post1462084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">&quot;<a href=\"https://prototype.fandom.com/wiki/Super_Soldier\" target=\"_blank\">Overzealous</a>&quot; is one word. &quot;Disease <i>prevention</i>&quot; is <a href=\"https://prototype.fandom.com/wiki/Redlight_virus\" target=\"_blank\">perhaps one too many</a>.</div> </div> </div> </div> Heh, sorry. Probably should have known relying on 5 ish years old half-remembered knowledge gained from browsing tv tropes probably wasn\u2019t reliable.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/deviant-the-renegades/1461816-monster-mash-2021-round-3-deviant?p=1462084#post1462084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As much as I would love to see <a href=\"https://worsethanmanyfairies.tumblr.com/post/171509469890/ladysmaragdina-xekstrin-dykemoira-both\" target=\"_blank\">Moira O'Deorain give a rabbit ghost powers</a>, I've only got the one vote to spend.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thanks for sharing this, the image made my morning.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>To whomever reads this, I hope you have a good day/night. May you be Happy.<br /> <br /> So, I made some Mage Legacies <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1497183-templebuilder-s-new-legacy-thread#post1497183\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>, with some help. They vary in quality, but I hope you take a look at them. Every one contains pieces of me, for better or worse.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26736-templebuilder","name":"TempleBuilder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26736_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1251"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-10-01T16:27:34-07:00","id":1462346,"title":"","content":"And the results are...<br /> <br /> A) 3<br /> B) 8<br /> C) 1<br /> D) 5<br /> <br /> So demon lawyers it is! I actually wasn't sure if Wolfram &amp; Hart was too obscure to get any votes, so that's kinda cool. <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mummy-the-curse/1462279-monster-mash-2021-round-4\">Next poll of Mummy is already up!</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-09-30T13:21:12-07:00","id":1494055,"title":"","content":"<i>Okay, there was a learning experience here. Standing 10 Conspiracies have a lot of moving parts and the sidebar suggesting not defining all the Nodes and Icons off the bat is your friend! I was going to do Lionel Hawk as a maxed out Conspiracy, but ended up scaling this writeup back to a much more manageable branch office.</i><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Truth faction within the Lucifuge has accounts of the Lion &amp; the Hawk going back centuries. They are foremost among Satan's generals, among Hell's most devious schemers. The Lucifuge is almost aware of a far more sinister and worrisome fact. The Lion &amp; the Hawk returned to earth over three centuries ago to form the law firm Lionel Hawk &amp; Associates. LHA would say they are not that different from the Lucifuge, both work together to embrace their fiendish heritage and try to change the world. Of course, changing the world for a law firm founded and staffed by demons means ushering in the apocalypse, but such details are semantics in the grand scheme of things.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">A sizeable contingent of employees have demonic ancestry (or are demons themselves) who got an employment offer from the firm before the Lucifuge found them. Most LHA employees are mortals, albeit mortals who learn occult secrets as part of their jobs. And then become part of occult rituals. And then become Deviants with fiends bound into their bones or spirits struggling to take over their twisted bodies. When you work for Lionel Hawk &amp; Associates, employment is a perpetual contract and you are expected to give your all, including your life.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">LHA has a decent track record with retaining their creations as Devoted, but they also recruit Renegades who slip away from other Conspiracies. Make no mistake either, when Lionel Hawk goes after a Deviant, they always start with the recruitment pitch rather than the tasers and unmarked vans. Their corporate scouts go out of their way to point out a Deviant\u2019s talents and how much easier the Associates can make a Deviant\u2019s life if they sign on the dotted line. They aren\u2019t above helping Deviants get revenge on other Conspiracies, if the cost to their reputation isn\u2019t too great. Above everything else, talent scouts want to make themselves seem reasonable and understanding, sympathetic to a Deviant\u2019s plight.</span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lionel Hawk &amp; Associates is a sprawling organization, with roots deep in mortal soil and hellfire. If written up in its entirety, it would surely comprise a high-Standing Conspiracy. The following statistics represent a local branch of LHA that focuses its efforts on a single city rather than the whole of reality.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Standing:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> 3</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Principles:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Bring Hell to Earth, Corrupt the righteous, Place the firm above yourself</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Virtue:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Remorseless. Hawk &amp; Associates work towards bringing about the Apocalypse and there is little they won\u2019t do to further that end. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Vice:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Honest. Despite stereotypes about lawyers, Hawk &amp; Associates have built a reputation by dealing openly with their clients. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Attributes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Power 3, Finesse 6, Resistance 3</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Conspiracy Actions:</b> 2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Association:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">6</span></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b>Hierarchical Node:</b> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Voice of the Lion. </span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Temporal Nodes: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Fiendish Legal Department</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Exploitative Nodes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"> Public Relations</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Structural Nodes:</span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Non-Human Resources, Demonic Research Division</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Undefined Nodes: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">2</span></span><br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Icons: </span></span></b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Devil\u2019s Oaths, Strength in Diversity</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">The Devil\u2019s Oaths (Fiendish Legal Department)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Conspiracy possesses an extensive archive of Devil's own deals, which lawyers consult in cases both occult and mundane. Lawyers working for Lionel Hawk gain an Occult specialization in Hell and an Academics specialization in Law. When using either specialization, they achieve an exceptional success on three successes.</span></span><br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Strength in Diversity (Non-Human Resources)</span></span></b><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\">Lionel Hawk &amp; Associates draws its expertise from every shadow, and possesses an eclectic cast of employees. Once per Chapter, when the Conspiracy recruits a Deviant they also recruit another non-Deviant supernatural. Transitional, this has meant contracting a vampire or summoning a demon, but any supernatural being is fair game for LHA's recruiters. </span></span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":4433,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","user":"Second Chances","date":". 09-30-2022, 04:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}